<title>GREECE: VOLLEYBALL- PANATHINAIKOS SIGNS ON JEFF NYGAARD FOR 96-97.</title>
<headline>VOLLEYBALL- PANATHINAIKOS SIGNS ON JEFF NYGAARD FOR 96-97.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's Panathinaikos Volleyball Club signed on Jeff Nygaard, a central blocker for the U.S. national volleyball team at the Atlanta Olympics for the 1996-97 season for an undisclosed amount, it said on Friday. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
